cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the original paper and the upstream neroRL implementation."
title: "Pokemon Red RL - independent reproduction and training supervision experiment (seed_0, 1M real environment steps)"
abstract: >-
  Independent reproduction of the Pokemon Red reinforcement-learning pipeline
  (PyBoy emulator + PPO, based on neroRL's poke_red branch and the paper
  "Pokemon Red via Reinforcement Learning"), plus a supervised long-training
  experiment reaching 1,000,000 real environment steps and a fixed-protocol
  independent evaluation. No game ROM, save state, model weights or gameplay
  video is distributed with this repository.
authors:
